# quail_temp_farm — umbrella-subsystem activation (option A).
#
# Assembly: 2x flash_click (SPI NOR, jedec,spi-nor) + 2x temp_click (I2C
# sensor). The rig's shields carry no Kconfig.defconfig of their own (only
# `SHIELD_<NAME>` identification symbols) — enabling the subsystems the
# instantiated shields' DRIVERS actually need is the rig's job, not the
# shield's or the expander's. Minimal: just the umbrellas.
CONFIG_SPI=y
CONFIG_FLASH=y
CONFIG_SENSOR=y
